  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the capacity of the Regional Conference of the Major Superiors of Southern Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is aimed to provide assistance in the development, leadership, and sustainability of RCMSSA. The underlying theory of change is that if RCMSSA is given the necessary support to grow, strengthen its organisational capacities, and enhance its effectiveness and sustainability, it will be more capable of serving as a regional leader and support the congregations of Catholic Sister across the national bishop conferences. By improving the governance structures, internal processes, and leadership training mechanisms of RCMSSA, the project will enable the organisation to increase its regional impact and enhance its role to support the leadership of Catholic sisters, empowering them to carry out their mandates more effectively and sustainably.</narrative>
  </description>
